      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Abiya mwenye jwa ku Yuda",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 15:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abiya ŵajinjile ucimwene wa ku Yuda, mu caka ca 18 ca ucimwene ŵa Yelobowamu ku Isalaeli, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.15.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.15.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 15:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nipo ŵalamulile ku Yelusalemu kwa yaka yitatu. Mama ŵawo ŵaliji Maaka, mwanace jwa Abisalomu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.15.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.15.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 15:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwenye Abiya ŵakuyisye yindu yosope yakusakala yiŵatendaga Lehobowamu, baba ŵawo. Nganiŵapikanila AMBUJE",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.15.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.15.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " mwakuwona, mpela muŵatendele Daudi,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.15.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.15.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " ambuje ŵawo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.15.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.15.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 15:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nambo ligongo lya Daudi, ambujegwe, AMBUJE ŵampele Abiya mwanace jwamlume, kuti talamulile Yelusalemu, jwalakwe ali awile.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.15.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.15.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1KI.11.36"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Ayi 11:36",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.15.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.15.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 15:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "AMBUJE ŵayitesile yindu yeleyi, ligongo lyakuti Daudi ndaŵi syosope ŵapikanile malamusi gawo AMBUJE, pakutenda yindu yakulungamika. Akaŵe ngani jimope jila ja Uliya Muhiti.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.15.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.15.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2SA.11.1+2SA.11.2+2SA.11.3+2SA.11.4+2SA.11.5+2SA.11.6+2SA.11.7+2SA.11.8+2SA.11.9+2SA.11.10+2SA.11.11+2SA.11.12+2SA.11.13+2SA.11.14+2SA.11.15+2SA.11.16+2SA.11.17+2SA.11.18+2SA.11.19+2SA.11.20+2SA.11.21+2SA.11.22+2SA.11.23+2SA.11.24+2SA.11.25+2SA.11.26+2SA.11.27"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Sam 11:1-27",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.15.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.15.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 15:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngondo jijapali pasikati pa Lehobowamu ni Yelobowamu japelengenye mpaka mu ndaŵi josope jiŵaliji Abiya mwenye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.15.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.15.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 15:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nipo yosope yiŵatesile Abiya piŵaliji mwenye yilembedwe m'buku ja Mbili ja Ayimwene ŵa ku Yuda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.15.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.15.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 15:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Myoyo Abiya ŵawile, nipo ŵamsicile m'malembe giŵagonile acinangolo ŵakwe, mu msinda wa Daudi. Nipo Asa mwanace jwakwe ŵajinjile ucimwene m'malo mwakwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.15.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.15.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Mwenye Asa jwa ku Yuda",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 15:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.15.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.15.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 15:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asa ŵajinjile ucimwene wa ku Yuda, mu caka ca 20 ca ucimwene wa Yelobowamu ku Isalaeli, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.15.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.15.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 15:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nipo ŵalamulile yaka 41 ku Yelusalemu. Ambujegwe ŵakongwe ŵaliji Maaka, mwanace jwamkongwe jwa Abisalomu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.15.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.15.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 15:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asa ŵatesile yindu yakwanonyelesya AMBUJE, mpela muŵatendele Daudi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.15.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.15.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 15:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ŵatyosisye mcilambo cakwe, acalume ni acakongwe ŵaŵatendaga ya cigwagwa m'malo muŵapopelelaga milungu ja unami, soni ŵajityosisye milungu josope ja unami jele jiŵapanganyisye acinangolo ŵakwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.15.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.15.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 15:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ŵatyosisye soni Maaka, ambujegwe ŵakongwe pa mpando wa ucimwene, ligongo ŵapanganyisye mlungu jwa unami, Ashela. Nipo Asa ŵakatenyekatenye mlungu jwa unamijo, ni ŵajile kumjoca ku Ciŵata ca Kidiloni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.15.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.15.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 15:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asa ŵaliji ŵakulupicika kwa AMBUJE umi wakwe wosope, atamose kuti nganagapasulanya malo gaŵapopelelaga milungu ja unami jila. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.15.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.15.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 15:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jwalakwe ŵayiŵisile m'Nyumba ja AMBUJE yida yosope yiŵayipelece babagwe kwa Mlungu, pamo ni yida ya silifa",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.15.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.15.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " ni ya golidi",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.15.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.15.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " yiŵayipelece jwalakwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.15.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.15.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 15:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.15.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.15.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 15:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwenye Asa jwa ku Yuda ni Mwenye Basha jwa ku Isalaeli ŵaliji mkumenyana ngondo kaŵili kaŵili, ndaŵi josope jiŵaliji mkulamulila mu ucimwene wawo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.15.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.15.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 15:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwenye Basha ni juŵajawile kuja kutanda ngondo ku cilambo ca Yuda, ni ŵatandite kutaŵa lipupa kusyungulila msinda wa Lama, kuti ŵalekasye ŵandu kwinjila kapena kukopoka mcilambo ca Yuda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.15.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.15.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 15:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Myoyo Mwenye Asa ŵajigele silifa josope ni golidi juŵasigele m'Nyumba ja AMBUJE ni ku nyumba ja mwenye, ŵayipelece kwa ŵakutumicila ŵakwe, kuti akayipelece kwa Mwenye Beni Hadadi mwenye jwa ku Siliya, mwanace jwa Tabilimoni cisukulu ca Hesiyoni, juŵatamaga ku Damasiko. Ŵasalile kuti pakuja kupeleka mtukawo akasale maloŵe aga; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.15.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.15.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 15:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Kwende tukamulane m'mwejo ni une, mpela muŵatendelaga baba ŵangu ni baba ŵenu. Namtumicisye silifa ni golidi kuti yiŵe mtuka kwenumwe. Sambano, conde mkase mkamulano wenu ni Mwenye Basha jwa ku Isalaeli, naga mkutenda myoyo jwalakwe tacileka kumenyana ngondo ni une.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.15.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.15.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 15:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.15.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.15.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 15:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwenye Beni Hadadi ŵakamulene nayo yiŵaŵecete Mwenye Asa yila, myoyo ŵatumisye acakulungwakulungwa ŵakulamulila ngondo ŵa ku Siliya, pamo ni asilikali ŵawo, kuja kuputa ngondo mcilambo ca Isalaeli. Nipo ŵasumwile misinda ja Iyoni, Dani, Abele Beti Maka, mbali ja mungulugulu Nyasa ja Galileya ni upande wosope wa cilambo ca Nafutali. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.15.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.15.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 15:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwenye Basha piŵayipikene yindu yeleyi, ŵalesile kutaŵa lipupa lila lya kusyungulila msinda ŵa Lama, ni ŵawujile kuja kutama ku Tilisa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.15.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.15.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 15:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.15.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.15.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 15:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nipo Mwenye Asa ŵaŵilasile ŵandu wosope ŵa ku Yuda, nganaleka mundu jwalijose, kuti ayice ku Lama kukamucisya kunyakula maganga ni yitela, yiŵataŵilaga Mwenye Basha lipupa lwakusyungulila msindawo. Yindu yeleyi Mwenye Asa ŵataŵile nayo lipupa lya kusyungulila msinda wa Geba ni msinda wa Misipa, jakusimanikwa mcilambo ca Benjamini. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.15.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.15.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 15:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yindu yine yosope yiŵayitesile Mwenye Asa piŵaliji mwenye, ya macili gakwe, ni misinda jiŵataŵile, yosopeyi yilembedwe m'buku ja Mbili ja Ayimwene ŵa ku Yuda. Nambo pa ŵacekulwipe ŵalwasile ulwele ŵa makongolo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.15.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.15.23"
