          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nipo Mwenye Asa ŵawile ni ŵamsicile m'malembe ga ucimwene mu msinda wa Daudi, nipo mwanace jwakwe lina lyakwe Yehoshafati, ni juŵajinjile ucimwene m'malo mwakwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.15.24",
