          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Basha mwanace jwa Ahiya, jwakutyocela mwiŵasa lya Isakala, ŵamtendele malindi Nadabu. Ŵamwuleje Nadabu ku Gibitoni, msinda wa Afilisiti, pa ndaŵi jele Nadabujo ni ŵandu ŵa ku Isalaeli, ŵaliji mkuputa ngondo mu msindamo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.15.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.15.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 15:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yindu yeleyi yatendekwe mu caka catatu ca ucimwene wa Asa ku Yuda. Myoyo Basha ŵajinjile ucimwene wa ku Isalaeli, m'malo mwa Nadabu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.15.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.15.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 15:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ali ajinjile ucimwenewo, ŵawuleje ŵandu wosope ŵa liŵasa lya Yelobowamu. Nganaleka mundu jwalijose jwa cijumi mwiŵasalyo, mpaka ŵalijonasile liŵasa lyosope lyene, mpela mwa maloŵe ga AMBUJE gaŵaŵecete kupitila mwa jwakutumicila jwawo, jwakulocesya",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.15.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.15.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " Ahiya jwa ku Shilo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.15.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.15.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
